{"reference":"2 Samuel 9","book":"2 Samuel","chapter":9,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"In the Larger Book","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Second Samuel traces David's rise and consolidation of the kingdom, then moves through the ark and the promise of a lasting dynasty before turning to royal abuse, household violence, rebellion, grief, and a closing appendix. Chapter 9 belongs within this broader movement of David's reign.","provenance_refs":["reader_path_2_samuel_009_c6a78147537767fc048b5bc9"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"fact"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}